<title>HONG KONG: Tern Properties interim net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Tern Properties interim net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   45.3	  vs  4.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0	   vs  2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  107.54 gain vs  4.20 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    114.82	vs  11.33</p>
<p>    Turnover		     39.80	 vs  34.36</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tern Properties Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 6-10, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 13, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Tern Properties engages in property investment and development and share investment.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of an investment property.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
